15 0 obj
<< /A 47 0 R /Alt (Four bar charts labeled A to D compare growth metrics of Xiangyaxiangzhan and Yuxiangyouzhan using different treatments indicated by colors. Chart A shows total fresh weight, B shows total dry weight, C shows root-to-shoot ratio, and D shows dry weight per seedling height. Yuxiangyouzhan generally has higher values, especially with treatment CK0. Different letters above bars indicate significant differences.) /K 0 /P 8 0 R /Pg 35 0 R /S /Figure /T () >>
endobj
16 0 obj
<< /A 48 0 R /Alt (Bar charts labeled A to G show the fresh weight and weight ratio of leaf, stem, root, and shoot for Xiangyaxiangzhan and Yuxiangyouzhan. Different colors represent treatments CK0, CK, T1, T2, T3, and T4. Each chart includes error bars and statistical significance letters.) /K 0 /P 8 0 R /Pg 36 0 R /S /Figure /T () >>
endobj
17 0 obj
<< /A 49 0 R /Alt (Eight bar graphs labeled A to H compare the dry weight and weight ratios of leaves, stems, roots, and shoots for Xiangyaxiangzhan and Yuxiangyouzhan under six conditions. Each graph contains bars in colors corresponding to CK0, CK, T1, T2, T3, and T4 treatments. Panel A shows leaf dry weight, B shows stem dry weight, C indicates root dry weight, D depicts shoot dry weight, E represents leaf dry weight ratio, F displays stem dry weight ratio, G illustrates root dry weight ratio, and H shows shoot dry weight ratio, each with standard error bars and significant differences marked by letters.) /K 0 /P 8 0 R /Pg 37 0 R /S /Figure /T () >>
endobj
18 0 obj
<< /A 50 0 R /Alt (Bar charts labeled A to G compare various plant metrics between Xiangyaxiangzhan and Yuxiangyouzhan. Metrics include plant height, root length, stem length, leaf length, leaf width, number of green leaves, and specific leaf weight. Each chart displays six color-coded treatments: CK0, CK, T1, T2, T3, and T4. Error bars and labels indicate data variation and statistical significance.) /K 0 /P 8 0 R /Pg 38 0 R /S /Figure /T () >>
endobj
19 0 obj
<< /A 51 0 R /Alt (Bar graphs displaying CAT activity in Xiangyaxiangzhan and Yuxiangyouzhan rice varieties under different treatments \(CK0, CK, T1, T2, T3, T4\). Panel A measures in root\(U·mg-1FW\), Panel B in leaf, and Panel C in stem tissue. Bars are color-coded corresponding to treatments. Error bars indicate variability, and letters denote statistical differences.) /K 0 /P 8 0 R /Pg 39 0 R /S /Figure /T () >>
endobj
20 0 obj
<< /A 52 0 R /Alt (Bar charts showing SOD activity in leaf, root, and stem for Xiangyaxiangzhan and Yuxiangyouzhan rice varieties. Chart A shows SOD in leaf, chart B in root, and chart C in stem. Six color-coded treatments, CK0 to T4, are compared. Each chart displays varying activity levels with error bars and significant differences marked by letters.) /K 0 /P 8 0 R /Pg 40 0 R /S /Figure /T () >>
endobj
21 0 obj
<< /A 53 0 R /Alt <> /K 0 /P 8 0 R /Pg 41 0 R /S /Figure /T () >>
endobj
22 0 obj
<< /A 54 0 R /Alt (Bar charts labeled A, B, and C compare MDA content in different rice varieties and treatments. Panel A shows MDA levels in roots, B in leaves, and C in stems, with color-coded bars representing treatments CK0, CK, T1, T2, T3, and T4. Error bars indicate variability. Data labels on bars show statistical significance.) /K 0 /P 8 0 R /Pg 42 0 R /S /Figure /T () >>
endobj
23 0 obj
<< /A 55 0 R /Alt (Bar charts labeled A, B, and C show POD activity in root, leaf, and stem tissues of two varieties: Xiangyaxianzhan and Yuxiangyouzhan. The bars represent six treatments: CK0, CK, T1, T2, T3, and T4, in various colors. Error bars indicate variability, and lowercase letters above bars denote statistical significance.) /K 0 /P 8 0 R /Pg 43 0 R /S /Figure /T () >>
endobj
24 0 obj
<< /A 56 0 R /Alt (Diagram illustrating the effects of micro-fertilizers and plant growth regulators on seedlings. The top section shows hands holding seedlings, labeled \215Stem SOD.\216 The bottom section depicts a machine transplanting seedlings, labeled \215Transplanting Injury.\216 Surrounding the diagram are terms: Indolebutyric acid, Gibberellin, Zinc fertilizer, and Magnesium fertilizer. Text indicates various plant metrics like Stem SOD, Root SOD, and Stem fresh weight.) /K 0 /P 8 0 R /Pg 44 0 R /S /Figure /T () >>
endobj
